{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ChessXpanse\u2122 is a game that captures the intensity of chess and pits one player against another in the midst of battle. In ChessXpanse, a player faces varying front lines as the starting positions of each game board differ.<br><br>There are six different game board sizes, the smallest is the 4 x 5 square board up through the largest 7 x 7 square board. Game boards are populated with the six traditional chess pieces in addition to three new pieces: the Mage, the Gatekeeper, and the Archer. All pieces are in close proximity to one another, and the battle is a fight to the death of the opponent\u2019s last King (of which there can be three).<br><br>Each of the 66 battles (11 per board size) can rotate four different directions creating 244 rotations in which the battles can be served.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3308260?t=1756907219","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3308260?t=1756907219","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308260/fce727feb46b3935960811015731bbb6cf59fe0c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756907219","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308260/fce727feb46b3935960811015731bbb6cf59fe0c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756907219","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ChessXpanse\u2122 is a game that captures the intensity of chess and pits one player against another in the midst of battle. In ChessXpanse, a player faces varying front lines as the starting positions of each game board differ.<br><br>There are six different game board sizes, the smallest is the 4 x 5 square board up through the largest 7 x 7 square board. Game boards are populated with the six traditional chess pieces in addition to three new pieces: the Mage, the Gatekeeper, and the Archer. All pieces are in close proximity to one another, and the battle is a fight to the death of the opponent\u2019s last King (of which there can be three).<br><br>Each of the 66 battles (11 per board size) can rotate four different directions creating 244 rotations in which the battles can be served.</p>","developers":["GameJillion"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3308260/6a46e71cf4fc9ebc92f0a545e18a2279b355aa21/header.jpg?t=1756907219","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 12<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257068838,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257068838/movie480.mp4?t=1756140889","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257068838/movie_max.mp4?t=1756140889"},"name":"ChessXpanse: Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257068838/9eaf1ad3097e5230fd6fb5ae881c3f63b52ca2e1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756140889","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257068838/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1756140889","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257068838/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1756140889"}}],"name":"ChessXpanse","pac